repository-code: "https://github.com/tonydzi/claude-workdir-sentry"
url: "https://github.com/tonydzi/claude-workdir-sentry"
abstract: >-
  A SessionStart hook for Claude Code that warns, in the model's own context, when a
  session starts outside the machine's canonical project directory - the failure mode
  where project memory, session history and CLAUDE.md silently never load. Stdlib
  Python 3, one file, fail-open. Free, MIT.
